{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PnpTbJMkVeijtn3eHD1Stb","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Firecrawl G2 reviews rating\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Scrapers / G2\",\"url\":\"https://crawlbase.com/g2-scraper\"},{\"title\":\"G2 Reviews Scraper PRO (Bypass Cloudflare & Filter by Stars) avatar\",\"url\":\"https://apify.com/aetherlabx/g2-reviews-scraper-pro\"},{\"title\":\"Firecrawl Review 2026: B2B Data Coverage, Pricing & SyncGTM Comparison\",\"url\":\"https://syncgtm.com/blog/firecrawl-review-2026\"},{\"title\":\"www.g2.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.g2.com/categories/project-management/enterprise?page=4\"},{\"title\":\"G2 Reviews Scraper 2026 avatar\",\"url\":\"https://apify.com/devcake/g2-reviews/api/cli\"},{\"title\":\"New G2 reviews avatar\",\"url\":\"https://apify.com/dionysus_way/new-g2-reviews?fpr=p2hrc6\"},{\"title\":\"New G2 reviews avatar\",\"url\":\"https://apify.com/dionysus_way/new-g2-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"G2 Reviews Scraper - No Proxy Needed\",\"url\":\"https://apify.com/zhorex/g2-reviews-scraper?fpr=97nrp4\"},{\"title\":\"firecrawl review and alternatives\",\"url\":\"https://thunderbit.com/ko/blog/firecrawl-review-and-alternatives\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up Firecrawl's actual G2 rating or review count. The results were mostly G2 scraper tools and third-party reviews.\n\n- **Third-party review:** SyncGTM's 2026 review gives Firecrawl 4.0/5, but that is the site's own score, not G2's. It rates Firecrawl \"excellent for web scraping, not built for B2B contact enrichment.\"\n- **Developer adoption:** That same review reports 40,000+ GitHub stars and 150,000+ companies using the platform. These are adoption figures, not user ratings.\n- **G2 scrapers:** The remaining results are Apify and Crawlbase tools for extracting G2 reviews. They don't contain Firecrawl's G2 data. One notes that G2's pros and cons are compiled from review feedback and grouped into themes.\n\nTo get the figure, check the Firecrawl listing directly at g2.com (likely a URL like g2.com/products/firecrawl/reviews). Star averages and review counts change often, so the live page is the reliable source.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"45cba469-0aa5-4da1-a307-ee33f316e527","uuid":"2459a6e9-ae56-4ff5-8317-4016121bb9f7","timestamp":"2026-10-17T17:47:32.289Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Firecrawl G2 reviews rating","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01XuLqUsXW69y94wncP3bGhd","content":[{"title":"Scrapers / G2","url":"https://crawlbase.com/g2-scraper"},{"title":"G2 Reviews Scraper PRO (Bypass Cloudflare & Filter by Stars) avatar","url":"https://apify.com/aetherlabx/g2-reviews-scraper-pro"},{"title":"Firecrawl Review 2026: B2B Data Coverage, Pricing & SyncGTM Comparison","url":"https://syncgtm.com/blog/firecrawl-review-2026"},{"title":"www.g2.com","url":"https://www.g2.com/categories/project-management/enterprise?page=4"},{"title":"G2 Reviews Scraper 2026 avatar","url":"https://apify.com/devcake/g2-reviews/api/cli"},{"title":"New G2 reviews avatar","url":"https://apify.com/dionysus_way/new-g2-reviews?fpr=p2hrc6"},{"title":"New G2 reviews avatar","url":"https://apify.com/dionysus_way/new-g2-reviews"},{"title":"G2 Reviews Scraper - No Proxy Needed","url":"https://apify.com/zhorex/g2-reviews-scraper?fpr=97nrp4"},{"title":"firecrawl review and alternatives","url":"https://thunderbit.com/ko/blog/firecrawl-review-and-alternatives"}]},"The search didn't turn up Firecrawl's actual G2 rating or review count. The results were mostly G2 scraper tools and third-party reviews.\n\n- **Third-party review:** SyncGTM's 2026 review gives Firecrawl 4.0/5, but that is the site's own score, not G2's. It rates Firecrawl \"excellent for web scraping, not built for B2B contact enrichment.\"\n- **Developer adoption:** That same review reports 40,000+ GitHub stars and 150,000+ companies using the